title: Government bans the <span style="color:#c2352b">Red Guards</span>!
subtitle: The <span style="color:#3D3D3D;">reactionary</span> judicial system has banned the <span style="color:#c2352b">Red Guards</span>.
view-if: not psi_in_government and (radicalisation > 8 or pnf_in_government) and not_participating = 1 and judicial_reform < 2 and rg_banned = 0
